  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "英文作文(一)",
    "sub_ename": "COMPOSITION (1)",
    "describe_ch": "本課程旨在教導學生基本英文寫作之過程及技巧，主題包括預寫技巧，寫作步驟，文章修改與編輯及同儕互評。寫作練習以不同修辭文體之段落寫作及句構練習為主。課程結合主題式文體分析與寫作實踐。透過寫作練習，同學將學習文章撰寫、編輯與修訂的技巧。與課同學將於學期末彙整完成的稿件，以作品集呈現。",
    "describe_eh": "This course equips students with basic writing skills such as prewriting techniques, steps in writing, and bases for revision and editing. Students’ assignments cover paragraph/essay writing in different rhetorical modes, and English sentence skill practices. Students will present a final portfolio displaying the outcomes of their writing drafts.",
